  "description": "Do Gyeong, an actor and former idol. Possessing a personality that strikes back twice for every punch he receives, he decides to return to school following the provocation of Cheol-Won, a colleague and arch-nemesis who dismisses him for not having graduated. Meanwhile, Jae-Ni, a photography student and fan of actor Cheol-Won, vows, \"I will never associate with a man who wears makeup again.\" Although she left behind a legendary photo that caused a sensation online, she ended up leaving him as a fan due to an unfortunate incident. Feeling empty, she chooses to return to school to focus on her life. Thus, at the same time, two legendary returning students have come back to Peace University. Gyeong and Jae-Ni seem to have a connection that is both there and nowhere. They meet in a class and somehow begin to get entangled in an unexpected way…\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
